  "description": "Working as a servant for the handsome Duke, Theodore Winston, was dreamy enough, but Alois is determined to win his heart. He has tried every trick in the book to seduce his master, only to be met with a fatherly pat on the head. When rumors of a new Duchess threaten his dreams, Alois makes a desperate plea to the heavens. The magic works a little too well by bringing a youthful and ruthless version of the Duke across time and into his arms. Now that the tables have turned, will Alois finally get the love he has been craving?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
